<http://www.spektrix.com/tidemarktheatre/event/65401ARRMBSGBRKRMPJDLPDLGHVCMRJJP>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "25th Anniversary Community Dinner";
  schema:description """
	This September, we're celebrating 25 years of bringing farmers, makers, food producers, and our community together—and we'd love for you to be part of it.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Imagine a long harvest table stretching beneath tents on Shoppers Row, filled with neighbours sharing a delicious meal made from the incredible food grown and produced by the Campbell River Farmers Market vendors. New friendships are formed, conversations flow, and together we celebrate a quarter century of supporting local food, local businesses, and community connections.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This dinner is more than an anniversary celebration. It's an opportunity to bring our community together around the table while showcasing the extraordinary products our farmers and food vendors grow and create.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Our goal is to serve 300 meals, including 200 ticketed guests and complimentary meals for community members who might not otherwise be able to attend. We are committed to making this an inclusive event where everyone has a place at the table.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>To make this vision a reality, we're inviting businesses, organizations, and community members to become early supporters. You can:<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>●      Purchase tickets or reserve a table of ten for your staff, family, or clients. Early commitments help us plan with confidence.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>●      Sponsor tickets so community members experiencing financial barriers can attend.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $25.00 <span class=\"ItalicText\">(+applicable taxes & fees)</span>
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-09-13T17:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/tidemarktheatre/files/d7518581-f629-42c9-843c-25800334511e.jpg>;
  schema:location <https://spektrix.com/tidemarktheatre/location/2201AVBSMNJRLVSBVJRSDNQHLHDGPHDLD>;
