<http://www.spektrix.com/tidemarktheatre/event/66201ANBJCCNMNTBQVCLNSBCLHRLCHCHL>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Billy & Elton - The Legacy";
  schema:description """
	<span class=\"BoldText\">Two legendary artists. One unforgettable night of music!</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Experience the greatest hits of <span class=\"BoldText\">Elton John and Billy Joel</span> in this spectacular live tribute celebrating two of the most iconic singer-songwriters of all time.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>From <span class=\"ItalicText\">Rocket Man, Crocodile Rock</span> and <span class=\"ItalicText\">Tiny Dancer</span> to <span class=\"ItalicText\">Piano Man, Uptown Girl</span> and <span class=\"ItalicText\">New York State of Mind</span>, <span class=\"BoldText\">Billy & Elton - The Legacy</span> delivers the songs you know and love with powerhouse vocals, incredible musicianship, dazzling performances and plenty of rock ’n’ roll energy.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Featuring acclaimed performers <span class=\"BoldText\">Mick Dalla-Vee as Elton John</span> and <span class=\"BoldText\">Michael Sicoly as Billy Joel</span>, this exciting production brings the music, personalities and spirit of two legendary performers to life on stage.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Whether you're a lifelong fan or simply love great live music, this is a show you won't want to miss!</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $46.45 Admission <span class=\"ItalicText\">(includes GST, + applicable taxes)</span>
""";
