<http://www.spektrix.com/tidemarktheatre/event/63201ARQTHLBSGNTKBMQBJSPDDGGNLSLL>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Caleb Hart with Sonic Alley ";
  schema:description """
	If you loved Caleb Hart and Sonic Alley at Live Streets, don't miss the chance to experience them at the Tidemark Theatre this November.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Fronted by internationally acclaimed singer-songwriter <span class=\"BoldText\">Caleb Hart</span>, Sonic Alley brings together musicians from Canada, Venezuela, Jamaica, and Tobago to create an infectious blend of reggae, Latin rhythms, soulful melodies, and feel-good grooves. Their music is rooted in connection, community, and the joy of bringing people together.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Known for electrifying live performances, Sonic Alley has built a reputation for getting audiences on their feet, whether they're playing intimate clubs, major festivals, or outdoor celebrations like Campbell River's Live Streets. Their debut single <span class=\"ItalicText\">Step Up</span> earned international recognition from <span class=\"ItalicText\">Rolling Stone Argentina</span>, and with new music on the horizon, the band continues to make waves on the global reggae scene.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>By the time November rolls around, we'll all be missing summer. Think of this as one last taste of sunshine, just when you need it most.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $38.00 Members, $43.00 Non-Members <span class=\"ItalicText\">(+applicable taxes & fees)</span>
""";
