<http://www.spektrix.com/tidemarktheatre/event/63601ADMSQGRMMGQMGKKVNLRCNJTJMRNT>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Classic Ronstadt";
  schema:description """
	American singer Linda Ronstadt is an award-winning superstar of both pop and country music. She has sold more than 100 million albums worldwide.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>By the end of the 1960’s, Ronstadt had become a solo artist. She put out several albums with a series of backing bands, one of them was the nucleus of the group that would become the Eagles.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Following a strong reception to her 1973 album \"Don't Cry Now” Ronstadt finally hit it big with “Heart Like a Wheel” (1974) In addition to the hits “You’re no Good” and “When will I be Loved” the album Featured a cover of Hank Williams “I can’t help it” (If Im still in Love with you) Which earned her the first of her 12 Grammy Awards.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Classic Ronstadt (The Legacy of Linda) is fronted by D.L. Car, a multi- talented octave vocalist who also portrays two other iconic female singers Ann Wilson in the popular Heart tribute “Barracuda and Pat Benatar in the tribute act “All Fired Up”.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Joining D.L. are a band consisting of some of the elite musicians on the Pacific West Coast.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><ul><li> Layla Vageois ( Vocals, Acoustic guitar & Keyboards)</li><li> Curtis Leippi (Drums & Percussion)</li><li> Brent Howard (Guitar & Vocals)</li><li> Mark Kenny (Bass & Vocals)</li><li> Darryl Hebert (Guitar, Keyboards,Pedal Steel, Banjo & Vocals)</li></ul><span><br/></span>Classic Ronstadt (The Legacy of Linda) are honoured to be performing the amazing music catalog of songs which have made “Linda Ronstadt” one of the first female superstars of both pop & country. Linda also helped develop, influence and eventually collaborate with Don Henley, Glen Frey, Bernie Leadon and Randy Meisner who went on to form the Eagles.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $49.50 Admission, $45.50 Groups 6+<span class=\"ItalicText\"> (Includes GST, + applicable fees)</span>
""";
