  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Dino Archie's Comedy Extravaganza";
  schema:description """
	Long Live the Low Road<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>One night. Four acclaimed comedians. One unforgettable show.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Headlined by Dino Archie, this all-star lineup brings together some of Canada’s funniest comics for an incredible evening of stand-up at the Tidemark Theatre.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Featuring:<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><ul><li> Dino Archie</li><li> Ivan Decker</li><li> Yumi Nagashima</li><li> Patrick Maliha</li></ul><span><br/></span>As seen on Conan, Jimmy Kimmel Live!, Netflix Is a Joke Festival, Just For Laughs Galas, CTV, and CBC’s The Debaters.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Whether you’re a longtime comedy fan or just looking for an amazing night out, this is a rare chance to catch four nationally touring comedians on one stage in Campbell River.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $63.00 Adults, $58.00 Senior/Student, $53.00 Child 18- <span class=\"ItalicText\">(+applicable taxes & fees)</span>
""";
