<http://www.spektrix.com/tidemarktheatre/event/53201AKJTJLSKDPDLPTMDVPTDGSNGNBPL>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Girls Night Out The Show";
  schema:description """
	<span class=\"BoldText\">Direct from Las Vegas!</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Girls Night Out The Show</span>®—the ultimate Ladies Night Out—is taking over the stage live at the <span class=\"BoldText\">Tidemark Theatre</span> on <span class=\"BoldText\">Wednesday, September 23rd at 7:30 PM</span>!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This high-energy, all-male dance revue will have you on the edge of your seat from start to finish with heart-pumping music, chiseled bodies, seductive routines, cheeky humor, and boy-next-door charm.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This isn’t the kind of show where you just sit and watch!<span class=\"BoldText\"> Girls Night Out The Show</span>® is a fully interactive, immersive experience thundering with excitement. Get ready to get a little wild in an empowering, fun-filled atmosphere and embark on an unforgettable night with your friends.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tickets sell fast—don’t wait! Get yours today!</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $79.95 VIP includes Meet & Greet, $64.95 Premium, $49.95 Select, $39.95 Admission <span class=\"ItalicText\">(includes GST + applicable fees)</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Content Warning: 19+ Event</span></span>
""";
