<http://www.spektrix.com/tidemarktheatre/event/65201ACRNVHVJBDMGRPJPBKVMQHKPTNJN>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Improv Comedy Rumble";
  schema:description """
	<span class=\"BoldText\">The 5-Star Rated Comedy Department has been wowing audiences at sold-out shows across Vancouver and the Lower Mainland – now they're bringing their biggest laughs to CAMPBELL RIVER with Improv Comedy Rumble!</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Three of Canada's best improvisers go head-to-head, making up hilarious comedy on the spot based on YOUR suggestions. Audience judges crown the winner and the crowd cheers on their favourite! Think Gladiator but with less death and more laughs.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">What Makes Improv Comedy Rumble Special?</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This isn't your typical improv show – it's a high-energy competition where three performers battle it out across multiple rounds. Each challenge pushes their funny-making and on-the-spot thinking to the limit. Will your favourite take the crown, or will an underdog steal the show?<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Every performance is completely unique. The scenes, characters, and jokes are created in real-time based on audience suggestions, which means you'll see something that's never happened before and will never happen again.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">What to Expect:</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><ul><li> Fast-paced improv competition with real stakes</li><li> Audience participation and exciting crowd work</li><li> Big laughs and unpredictable comedy moments</li><li> Interactive judging that puts the audience in control</li></ul><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">About The Comedy Department</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.thecomedydepartment.com/\">www.thecomedydepartment.com</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>They've been delivering top-tier improv comedy across the province and beyond  for decades, earning a reputation for sold-out shows and five-star reviews. Their recent TripAdvisor Traveller's Choice Award confirms what audiences already know - these performers bring the laughs every single time.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://bit.ly/493ha77\">TripAdvisor 5-Star Reviews!</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Cast Credits</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The Comedy Department ensemble are Canadian Comedy Award-winners who have toured internationally and performed alongside improv legends Colin Mochrie and Ryan Stiles.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><ul><li> Just for Laughs</li><li> Just For Laughs Vancouver</li><li> The Second City</li><li> The Improv Centre</li><li> Vancouver Theatre Sports League</li><li> The Comic Strippers</li><li> Underground Comedy Club</li><li> Yuk Yuks</li><li> Don’t Tell Comedy</li><li> The Laugh Factory</li><li> The Improv</li><li> 1000’s of TV and in feature film credits</li></ul><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Don't Miss Out!</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Grab your tickets now! Whether you're looking for a fun night out with friends or an unforgettable date night, Improv Comedy Rumble delivers non-stop entertainment.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Follow Us on Instagram Facebook TikTok YouTube<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets: $49 Admission, $44 Senior/Group 6+ <span class=\"ItalicText\">(+applicable taxes & fees)</span>
""";
